# FoodBridge — Smart Surplus Food Redistribution Platform (Final Plan)

A hackathon-ready MERN stack app for **Track 1: Zero Hunger** that connects food donors (messes, restaurants) with NGO shelters through verified volunteers — featuring demand forecasting, route optimization, food safety checks, impact reporting, multilingual access, and several **advanced concepts** to stand out.

---

## Advanced Concepts Added

| # | Concept | Why It Stands Out |
|---|---------|-------------------|
| 1 | **Real-time with Socket.IO** | Live push notifications when donations are created, claimed, picked, delivered — no page refresh needed |
| 2 | **QR Code Handover Verification** | Generate unique QR per donation; volunteer scans at pickup, shelter scans at delivery — tamper-proof chain of custody |
| 3 | **Smart Matching Algorithm** | Auto-match surplus to nearest shelter by proximity, capacity, and dietary compatibility — not just manual claiming |
| 4 | **Gamification & Leaderboard** | Points, badges (First Donation, 100 Meals Saved, Speed Demon), and donor/volunteer leaderboards to drive engagement |
| 5 | **Geolocation Proximity Alerts** | When a new donation is posted, auto-notify volunteers within a configurable radius using geo queries |
| 6 | **Interactive Analytics Heatmap** | Leaflet heatmap showing donation density by area — visually impressive for demo |
| 7 | **PWA Support** | Service worker + manifest for installable app with offline caching — works on low-end devices |
| 8 | **Expiry Countdown & Auto-Archive** | Real-time countdown timers on donations, auto-expire listings past their safety window |

---

