## Proposed Changes

### Backend (Express + MongoDB Atlas + Socket.IO)

#### [NEW] [package.json](file:///c:/FoodBridge/backend/package.json)
Dependencies: `express`, `mongoose`, `cors`, `dotenv`, `bcryptjs`, `jsonwebtoken`, `multer`, `express-validator`, `socket.io`, `qrcode`, `geolib`

#### [NEW] [.env](file:///c:/FoodBridge/backend/.env)
`MONGO_URI`, `JWT_SECRET`, `PORT=5000`

#### [NEW] [server.js](file:///c:/FoodBridge/backend/server.js)
Express + HTTP server + Socket.IO init, MongoDB connect, CORS, route mounting, real-time event broadcasting

#### [NEW] [config/db.js](file:///c:/FoodBridge/backend/config/db.js)
Mongoose connection helper with retry logic

---

#### Models (`models/`)

| File | Key Fields |
|------|------------|
| `User.js` | name, email, password, role (`donor`/`volunteer`/`ngo`/`admin`), phone, language, verified, documents[], rating, **points, badges[], location {type: Point, coordinates}** |
| `Donation.js` | donor ref, foodType, quantity, preparedAt, expiresAt, status, photos[], freshnessBadge, **qrCode, matchedShelter ref, handoverVerified, expiryCountdown** |
| `DemandForecast.js` | donor ref, date, predictedSurplus, actualSurplus |
| `Route.js` | volunteer ref, waypoints[], optimizedOrder[], distance, estimatedTime |
| `ImpactReport.js` | period, totalMealsSaved, co2Avoided, donorBreakdown[] |
| **[NEW]** `Leaderboard.js` | user ref, role, totalPoints, totalMeals, rank, badges[] |

> [!NOTE]
> `User.location` uses MongoDB `2dsphere` index for geo-proximity queries (find volunteers near a donation).

---

#### Routes & Controllers

| Route Group | Key Endpoints |
|-------------|---------------|
| **Auth** | `POST /register`, `POST /login`, `GET /me` |
| **Users** | `GET /ngos`, `PATCH /:id/verify`, `PATCH /:id/rate` |
| **Donations** | Full CRUD + `PATCH /claim` + `PATCH /complete` + `POST /photo` |
| **Forecast** | `GET /forecast/:donorId` — 7-day moving-average prediction |
| **Routes** | `POST /optimize` — nearest-neighbor optimized multi-stop |
| **Impact** | `GET /report?period=monthly` — meals, CO2, per-donor stats |
| **Alerts** | `POST /send` — simulated multilingual SMS |
| **[NEW] Match** | `POST /api/match/:donationId` — auto-find best shelter by proximity + capacity |
| **[NEW] QR** | `GET /api/qr/:donationId` — generate QR, `POST /api/qr/verify` — scan & verify handover |
| **[NEW] Leaderboard** | `GET /api/leaderboard?role=donor` — ranked list with badges |
| **[NEW] Geo** | `GET /api/nearby/volunteers?lat=x&lng=y&radius=5` — find nearby volunteers |
| **[NEW] Heatmap** | `GET /api/analytics/heatmap` — donation coordinates with intensity for map overlay |

#### Middleware
- `auth.js` — JWT + role guards
- `upload.js` — Multer for photos
- **`socket.js`** — Socket.IO event emitter helper (broadcast `new-donation`, `donation-claimed`, `donation-delivered`)
- **`expiry.js`** — Cron-style checker to auto-archive expired donations

