## Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Frontend["React + Vite (Port 5173)"]
        LP[Landing Page]
        AUTH[Auth Pages]
        DD[Donor Dashboard]
        VD[Volunteer Dashboard]
        ND[NGO Dashboard]
        AD[Admin Dashboard]
        LB[Leaderboard]
    end

    subgraph Backend["Express + Socket.IO (Port 5000)"]
        API[REST APIs]
        WS[WebSocket Events]
        MW[Middleware - Auth/Upload]
        MATCH[Smart Matching Engine]
        FORECAST[Demand Forecaster]
        ROUTE[Route Optimizer]
        QR[QR Generator/Verifier]
        GEO[Geo Proximity Engine]
    end

    subgraph DB["MongoDB Atlas"]
        Users[(Users + 2dsphere)]
        Donations[(Donations)]
        Forecasts[(Forecasts)]
        Impact[(Impact Reports)]
        Leaders[(Leaderboard)]
    end

    Frontend -->|HTTP + WS| Backend
    Backend --> DB
    WS -->|Real-time| Frontend
```

