## Verification Plan

### Automated (CLI + Browser)
1. Backend health: `curl localhost:5000/api/auth/me` → 401
2. Register → Login → JWT returned
3. Donation CRUD: create → list → claim → complete
4. QR: generate for donation → verify scan
5. Forecast: seed data → GET predictions → values returned
6. Route: POST waypoints → optimized order returned
7. Match: POST match → nearest shelter selected
8. Leaderboard: create donations → points increment → rank updates
9. Heatmap: GET heatmap data → coordinate array returned

### Manual (Browser Demo Flow)
1. Landing page → dark theme with animated counters
2. Register as Donor → create listing → QR code generated → real-time toast fires
3. Register as Volunteer → see nearby pickups → view optimized route on map → scan QR
4. Register as NGO → see incoming donations → view 7-day forecast chart → verify delivery QR
5. Register as Admin → verify NGO documents → view impact report with charts → view heatmap
6. Open Leaderboard → see ranked donors & volunteers with badges
7. Switch language → Hindi → all UI text updates
8. Test on mobile viewport → responsive layout works

