## Build Order
1. Backend setup → DB connection → Models (with geo indexes)
2. Auth routes + JWT middleware
3. Donation CRUD + QR generation + Socket.IO events
4. Forecast, Route Optimizer, Smart Matching, Geo queries, Leaderboard APIs
5. Impact reporting + Heatmap data endpoint
6. Frontend scaffold → theme → routing → auth context
7. Auth pages → Landing page
8. Role-based dashboards + all feature pages
9. Real-time Socket.IO integration + QR components
10. i18n, PWA manifest, polish & responsiveness
